  "historical_output_text": " Share why it brings pleasure. You might include how often the hobby takes you to do the thing (for instance weekly), how often in your free or not as much time in general you do that particular action. Use details like colors, shapes and other descriptive adjectivial details.\nAbsolutely adore the sun, the sky... and I'm hooked into something new. It all starts by walking down my favorite trail at dusk when there’s no more heat and a slight chill sets my senses tingly. My phone lights the dark trail with a red screen, illuminator in one pocket to see all around with. I grab one stick after an hour of trek and I start drawing on trees and rocks along. My first stick I made is the biggest one I have. The stick I am working today on? I think its more a branch but it has that right",
